      "observed": "R47 is specified as 24k in its value field, but its MPN is FRC0805J240TSD and its description says 24Ω. It is connected directly across VOUTN and VOUTP.",
      "expected": "The sourced part should match the specified 24k value; alternatively, the design value should be corrected if 24Ω is intended. The BOM fields should not specify conflicting resistance values.",
